GLM-5.3-Flash's own forward is mlx-serve's glm5_next, and its speed changes are mlx-serve #1196's (closed; they
moved out of mlx-serve into this plugin). mlx-serve keeps its own glm5_next for every pack this plugin does not
claim, so these files can drift from it. Their imports point at this plugin's files and the kit; each names its
origin in a `copied_from:` line:

  plugin.zig                 src/plugins/glm5_next/plugin.zig@385c3957 (its Sushi bill and affine fused decode out)
  config.zig                 src/plugins/glm5_next/config.zig@385c3957 (`readGlm`, `glmFacts`; vision out)
  src/glm5_next.zig          src/plugins/glm5_next/glm5_next.zig@385c3957 (tests, affine MoE decode, per-head qmv out)
  src/dsa_nax.zig            src/plugins/glm5_next/dsa_nax.zig@4bab19a5
  src/table_forward.zig      src/plugins/glm5_next/table_forward.zig@385c3957, with #1196's (4bab19a5) wiring
  src/head.zig               src/plugins/glm5_next/head.zig@385c3957, with #1196's (4bab19a5) wiring
  src/kda_verify.zig         src/plugins/glm5_next/kda_verify.zig@4bab19a5
  src/kda_prologue.zig       src/plugins/glm5_next/kda_prologue.zig@4bab19a5
  src/kda_chunk.zig          src/plugins/glm5_next/kda_chunk.zig@4bab19a5
  src/kda_percore.zig        src/plugins/glm5_next/kda_percore.zig@4bab19a5
  src/dsa_prompt.zig         src/plugins/glm5_next/dsa_prompt.zig@4bab19a5
  src/dsa_append.zig         src/plugins/glm5_next/dsa_append.zig@4bab19a5
  src/router_nax.zig         src/sdk/blocks/moe/router_nax.zig@4bab19a5 (the trunk's router hook is this plugin's)
  src/gpu_tests.zig          the tests of the files above at 4bab19a5, at fewer cases
  src/kernels/*.metal        src/plugins/glm5_next/kernels/@385c3957 (moe_gate_up, moe_down, head_qmv out) and
                             @4bab19a5 (dsa_prompt_index, dsa_tails, kda_chunk, kda_prologue, kda_verify_gate);
                             src/kernels/moe/router_nax_*@4bab19a5

The KDA-hybrid trunk these files run on (the loader, KDA layer, slots and table glue) is the kit's
(`kit.bases.kda_hybrid`), not a copy.

