From oMLX 0.7.0, by way of mlx-serve (its NOTICE carries the full entry):

  * The sparse latent attention on the tensor units (src/dsa_nax.zig, src/kernels/dsa_sparse_nax*.metal), from
    `omlx/patches/glm_moe_dsa/sparse_mla_nax.py`, and the indexer scores on the tensor units
    (src/kernels/dsa_indexer_nax.metal), from `omlx/patches/glm_moe_dsa/indexer_nax.py`, whose MMAs
    src/kernels/dsa_prompt_index.metal runs a row at a time.
  * The per-core KDA prefill recurrence src/kda_percore.zig launches (the kit's `kda_percore.metal`), generated by
    `omlx/patches/glm53_kda_recurrence.py`.
  * From `omlx/patches/mlx_vlm_glm5_next_compat/decode_kernels.py`: the selected-pool expansion and the design of
    the one-dispatch hyper-connection collapse with the expand deferred into the next sublayer (`hcPre`; the
    cross-threadgroup reduction is mlx-serve's).

