src/glm5_next.zig's numerics follow mlx-vlm's `glm5_next`; its fused Sinkhorn collapse is mlx-vlm's
`deepseek_v4/hyper_connection.py` `_make_hc_sinkhorn_collapse_kernel` (src/kernels/gates_header.metal,
collapse.metal). src/router_nax.zig runs MLX's `GEMVKernel` from `gemv.h`, embedded from the kit's MLX headers with
its operand types and its output store edited at compile time, and src/kernels/router_nax_p1.metal reproduces MLX's
split-K NAX GEMM (`steel_gemm_splitk_nax`) over MLX's `steel/gemm/nax.h`.
